やっぱり飲食業とか、これを大企業扱いにされて除外されると、これでいいんですかと言っているんです。やっ…", "…きめ細かくちゃんと届く仕組みにしなければいけないでしょうと。野党は、企業規模にかかわらず休業支援給付金の対象にする、共同で法案も出しておりま…"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/468", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/470", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/472", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/474", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/476", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/478", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/480", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/482", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/484", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/486", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/488", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/490", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120315261X00220201106/492", "sentence": []}]}]}, {"date": "2021-01-22", "meeting": [{"meeting_name": "参議院 本会議", "remarks": [{"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415254X00320210122/17", "sentence": ["…例の縮小、休業支援金の打切りも撤回し、感染収束まで継続し、対象を中堅企業や大手チェーン店などの労働者にも拡大すべきではありませんか。コロナ禍…"]}]}]}, {"date": "2021-01-28", "meeting": [{"meeting_name": "参議院 予算委員会", "remarks": [{"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415261X00220210128/332", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415261X00220210128/335", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415261X00220210128/339", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415261X00220210128/342", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415261X00220210128/345", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120415261X0022021012